# Fear of the Dark II (ahtUrhgan 14) with GIL_RATE 1.5: the 200 gil of the first completion (16) and of the repeat (18)
# is scaled by the rate (the trace shows the char_inventory rows, itemId 65535).
lists AlZahbi/Suldiran/onTrigger AlZahbi/Suldiran/onTrade AlZahbi/onEventFinish/14 AlZahbi/onEventFinish/16 AlZahbi/onEventFinish/18
char zone=AlZahbi pos=41.658,-5.999,-42.528 job=WAR lvl=75
setting GIL_RATE 1.5
item ImpWing x4
login
trigger Suldiran                        # available: 14
finish option=1                         # begun
trade Suldiran ImpWing x2               # 16
finish                                  # completed; 200 gil x rate
trade Suldiran ImpWing x2               # completed: 18
finish                                  # 200 gil x rate
